000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     TPPRNT.
      *C
      *C 09/10/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND THE INPUT FILE FOR THE INCLUSION
      *C   OF CENTURY ON THE DATE.  HOWEVER, DO NOT
      *C   DISPLAY THE CENTURY ON SCREEN/PRINT.
      *C
000900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001100 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    AS400.
001200 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.      C01 IS NEW-PAGE
                           I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                           LOCAL-DATA IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
001500 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001600 FILE-CONTROL.
001800     SELECT DISK-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-TEMPPERS
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RELATIVE KEY IS AKEY
               FILE STATUS IS DF-STATUS.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZPERSON-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DSPLY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
001700     SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
002300 DATA DIVISION.
002400 FILE SECTION.
003000 FD  DISK-FILE RECORD CONTAINS 52 CHARACTERS
003100     DATA RECORD IS DISK-REC.
003200 01  DISK-REC.
003300     05  SRT-1           PIC X(4).
003400     05  SRT-2           PIC X(16).
003500     05  SRT-3           PIC X(2).
003600     05  SRT-4           PIC X(4).
003700     05  SRT-6           PIC X(4).
003800     05  SRT-7           PIC X(10).
003900     05  SRT-8           PIC X(2).
004000     05  SRT-9           PIC X(2).
004100     05  SRT-5-CN.
               10  CC          PIC X(2).
           05  SRT-5.
004200         10 YY           PIC X(2).
004300         10 MM           PIC X(2).
004400         10 DD           PIC X(2).
004500******************************************************
004600*   SRT-1 IS CC-NUM                                  *
004700*   SRT-2 IS NAME                                    *
004800*   SRT-3 IS CRAFT                                   *
004900*   SRT-4 IS ZONE                                    *
005000*   SRT-6 IS DEPT                                    *
005100*   SRT-7 IS LABOR-RATE                              *
005200*   SRT-8 IS RATING                                  *
005300*   SRT-9 IS SHIFT/CREW                              *
005400*   SRT-5 IS CSD                                     *
005500******************************************************
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSPLY-REC                   PIC X(2000).
002500 FD  PRINT-FILE RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
002600     LABEL RECORD IS OMITTED
002700     DATA RECORD IS PRT-REC.
002800 01  PRT-REC             PIC X(132).
005700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
